      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "### Does clicking a point on the graph take me to the right span?\nEach **orange cell** is a duration bucket (the lighter, the more requests). Each **blue dot** is an **exemplar**: a real request in that bucket, with its `trace_id`.\n\n**How to use it:** hover over a blue dot → click **View trace** → the trace opens in Tempo with one span highlighted → on the span, **Logs for this span** opens the correlated error log.\n\n**Gap A43 (open):** in Go and .NET, the exemplar of the SDK database metric highlights the **parent** span (the caller of the database), not the database span. Compare the two graphs below: the right one (derived from the spans) highlights the right span. Node.js records no exemplars on SDK metrics; Python emits no database metric.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "The SDK's `db.client.operation.duration` histogram (Go, Node.js, .NET); exemplars only in Go and .NET. Open a blue dot and see which span is highlighted: the parent, while A43 is open. Once A43 is fixed, it should be the database span.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "calculate": false,
        "cellGap": 1,
        "color": {
          "exponent": 0.5,
          "fill": "dark-orange",
          "mode": "scheme",
          "scheme": "Oranges",
          "steps": 64
        },
        "exemplars": {
          "color": "rgba(80,160,255,1)"
        },
        "filterValues": {
          "le": 1e-09
        },
        "legend": {
          "show": false
        },
        "rowsFrame": {
          "layout": "auto"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "showColorScale": true,
          "yHistogram": true
        },
        "yAxis": {
          "axisPlacement": "left",
          "unit": "s"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "exemplar": true,
          "expr": "sum by (le) (rate(db_client_operation_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=~\"demo-(${lang:pipe})-(api|backend|worker)\", service_name=~\"${service:pipe}\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "format": "heatmap",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{le}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Database — SDK metric: the exemplar opens the PARENT span (A43, wrong)",
      "type": "heatmap"
    },
